{"4141760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NERO", "steam_appid": 4141760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/c259e610674b71d7e917cbca5c805271.avif?t=1776046486\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;The war was the easy part. Rebuilding after... not so much&quot;</i></strong><br><br><i>Uncle</i> <i>Croaks</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’re a green entrepreneur with a simple dream: feed the people. Start with a rundown seaside stall and build it into a legendary restaurant in a brutal archipelago where pirates shake down ports, savage saltwater crocodile gangs stalk the waterways, corrupt imperial tax collectors want their cut, and hungry killers circle your back door looking for their next meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/b9ca4a0b2df87fd40e82e92e4bdbf064.poster.avif?t=1776046486\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/b9ca4a0b2df87fd40e82e92e4bdbf064.webm?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/b9ca4a0b2df87fd40e82e92e4bdbf064.mp4?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through progressively hostile fishing zones, from peaceful shallows to storm-ravaged depths. <strong>Face 30-foot waves, nightmarish deep-sea horrors, and ruthless pirates</strong> who want to board your ship, kill the crew, and steal everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/09d9c9664d631e801216bdcb20e5ae86.poster.avif?t=1776046486\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/09d9c9664d631e801216bdcb20e5ae86.webm?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/09d9c9664d631e801216bdcb20e5ae86.mp4?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master your culinary craft  under threat of a rowdy clientele that grows more plastered and demanding. <strong>Invent sushi with wild effects, hearty gumbos, and ramen that feels vaguely alive.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/8d3cadb0a26241a1085400e9575ef784.poster.avif?t=1776046486\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/8d3cadb0a26241a1085400e9575ef784.webm?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/8d3cadb0a26241a1085400e9575ef784.mp4?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there were a competition on best bosses, you would come dead last. <strong>Work to completely automate your operations</strong>, hiring and firing chefs, fishermen and swordsmen to keep your fragile business afloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/28b1242bfdfdc45b808a8eba905ecf0a.poster.avif?t=1776046486\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/28b1242bfdfdc45b808a8eba905ecf0a.webm?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/28b1242bfdfdc45b808a8eba905ecf0a.mp4?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is an industry secret, but the restaurant business depends on frequent alleyway knife fights and tenuous political alliances. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You are not special and you certainly are not the hero.</i></strong><i> You are a humble frog out to build a living.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This is going to be</i></strong> <strong><i>complete fucking chaos.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/c259e610674b71d7e917cbca5c805271.avif?t=1776046486\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/c259e610674b71d7e917cbca5c805271.avif?t=1776046486\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;The war was the easy part. Rebuilding after... not so much&quot;</i></strong><br><br><i>Uncle</i> <i>Croaks</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You’re a green entrepreneur with a simple dream: feed the people. Start with a rundown seaside stall and build it into a legendary restaurant in a brutal archipelago where pirates shake down ports, savage saltwater crocodile gangs stalk the waterways, corrupt imperial tax collectors want their cut, and hungry killers circle your back door looking for their next meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/b9ca4a0b2df87fd40e82e92e4bdbf064.poster.avif?t=1776046486\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/b9ca4a0b2df87fd40e82e92e4bdbf064.webm?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/b9ca4a0b2df87fd40e82e92e4bdbf064.mp4?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through progressively hostile fishing zones, from peaceful shallows to storm-ravaged depths. <strong>Face 30-foot waves, nightmarish deep-sea horrors, and ruthless pirates</strong> who want to board your ship, kill the crew, and steal everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/09d9c9664d631e801216bdcb20e5ae86.poster.avif?t=1776046486\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/09d9c9664d631e801216bdcb20e5ae86.webm?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/09d9c9664d631e801216bdcb20e5ae86.mp4?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master your culinary craft  under threat of a rowdy clientele that grows more plastered and demanding. <strong>Invent sushi with wild effects, hearty gumbos, and ramen that feels vaguely alive.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/8d3cadb0a26241a1085400e9575ef784.poster.avif?t=1776046486\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/8d3cadb0a26241a1085400e9575ef784.webm?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/8d3cadb0a26241a1085400e9575ef784.mp4?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there were a competition on best bosses, you would come dead last. <strong>Work to completely automate your operations</strong>, hiring and firing chefs, fishermen and swordsmen to keep your fragile business afloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/28b1242bfdfdc45b808a8eba905ecf0a.poster.avif?t=1776046486\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/28b1242bfdfdc45b808a8eba905ecf0a.webm?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/28b1242bfdfdc45b808a8eba905ecf0a.mp4?t=1776046486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is an industry secret, but the restaurant business depends on frequent alleyway knife fights and tenuous political alliances. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You are not special and you certainly are not the hero.</i></strong><i> You are a humble frog out to build a living.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This is going to be</i></strong> <strong><i>complete fucking chaos.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/extras/c259e610674b71d7e917cbca5c805271.avif?t=1776046486\" width=900 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Become a chain-smoking, tax-dodging restaurateur on the brink of ruin. Sail blood-churned seas to feed starving killers who demand fine dining. Expand your empire from beach shack to world-class dining, or die trying.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/f260ff5fa82874eb15ec6086b5b125eeec37ee38/header.jpg?t=1776046486", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141760/0eea24a51d5516352755dd10b02a658007d399b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776046486", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app